# Build context hygiene. Anything listed here is invisible to `docker build`,
# which keeps the image small AND keeps secrets out of it.

# Dependencies are installed inside the image, never copied from the host —
# host node_modules may contain platform-specific binaries.
**/node_modules

# The frontend is compiled inside stage 1. The committed build/ (which Render
# serves) must not be copied in, or a stale bundle could shadow the fresh one.
frontend/build

# Uploaded files are runtime data, served from a volume — not image content.
backend/uploads

# --- secrets: never bake these into an image layer ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/serviceAccountKey.json

# VCS, tooling and docs
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
DOCKER.md
README.md
TECHNICAL_GAP_ANALYSIS.md
*.docx
*.zip

# Local noise
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.DS_Store
**/coverage
